    <string name="privacy_policy_content">1. DATA COLLECTION\nMacroKap collects minimal data required for operation. This includes device identity for pairing (hashed ANDROID_ID) and optional analytics if enabled in settings.\n\n2. NETWORK SECURITY\nConnections are secured using cryptographic handshakes (RSA/AES) when secure mode is enabled. Your server fingerprint is stored locally.\n\n3. THIRD PARTY SERVICES\nWe use AdMob for advertisements and Firebase for analytics. These services may collect data as governed by their respective privacy policies.\n\n4. DATA RETENTION\nWe do not store your macro data on our servers. All macro configurations are stored on your own desktop server.\n\nEND OF PRIVACY POLICY.</string>
