    <string name="tos_content">1. ACCEPTANCE OF TERMS\nBy using MacroKap, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, do not use the application.\n\n2. DESCRIPTION OF SERVICE\nMacroKap is a remote control and macro execution tool for desktop computers. It connects your mobile device to a local or global server to send commands.\n\n3. USER RESPONSIBILITIES\nYou are responsible for the security of your server and the macros you create. MacroKap is not responsible for any damage caused by executed macros.\n\n4. NO WARRANTY\nTHE SERVICE IS PROVIDED \&quot;AS IS\&quot; WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND.\n\n5. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY\nMacroKap shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive damages.\n\nEND OF TERMS.</string>
